OL,3,ATrump addresses UN General Assembly
OL,4,Aafter Guterres says 'world faultlines
OL,5,Awidening'
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump is addressing
OL,8,Fthe United Nations General Assembly in
OL,9,FNew York - watch live above
OL,11,FNearly 130 heads of state and
OL,12,Fgovernment attend the annual week-long
OL,13,Fevent to deliver a message from their
OL,14,Fnation to the world
OL,16,FOpening this year's seesion, UN
OL,17,FSecretary General Antonio Guterres says
OL,18,F"faultlines in our world are widening"
